    "b-80-ch-d2-why": {
      "id": "b-80-ch-d2-why",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Why.",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " A standalone checkout without the sibling prompt-kit repo must still boot; only prompt-edit sessions lose their agent. The unlisted flag keeps the shared bundle spawnable without adding it to this kernel's catalog listing, the same shape as canvas-agent's "
